{"ex-E304-1":{"id":"ex-E304-1","chapter":"E304","number":1,"title":"比較不同原子核的穩定性","question":"<p>下表列出碳-12（C-12）原子核、</p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>C-12 原子核</p></td><td><p>11.996 710 u</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>質子</p></td><td><p>1.007 276 u</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>中子</p></td><td><p>1.008 665 u</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>質子和中子的質量，以原子質量單位（u）表示。</p><p>(a) C-12 原子核有 6 個質子和 6 個中子。計算其結合能及每核子結合能，以 MeV 表示。</p><p>(b) 鈾-234（U-234）原子核的質量虧損為 1.909 380 u。解釋 C-12 與 U-234 哪種原子核較穩定。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) Δ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6 × 1.007 276 + 6 × 1.008 665 – 11.996 710 = 0.098 936 u 結合能 = 0.098 936 × 931 = 92.1 MeV</p><p>每個核子結合能 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>92.1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{92.1}{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 7.68 MeV</p><p>(b) 鈾-234 原子核的每個核子結合能</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>931</mn></mrow><mi>A</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{Δm \\times  931}{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.909380</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>931</mn></mrow><mn>234</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1.909 380 \\times  931}{234}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 7.60 MeV</p><p>碳-12 原子核的每個核子結合能較大，所以較穩定。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E304_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"fe67be946f6c7a0b0febd024507af8bce41fed7f65ad19662b0c0b1784b0188e","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,348.6458951171875,557.6491,547.9617919921875],"text":"例 題 1 比較不同原子核的穩定性\r\n表中列出了碳-12 原子核、質子和中\r\n子的質量，並以原子質量單位 (u) 來\r\n表達。\r\n(a) 碳-12 原子核由 6 個質子和 6 個中子組成，計算它的結合能和每個\r\n核子結合能，答案以 MeV 為單位。\r\n(b) 鈾-234 原子核的質量虧損為 1.909 380 u。試 解 釋 碳-12 和\r\n鈾-234 的原子核哪一個較穩定。\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,547.9617919921875,557.6491,743.3698951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) Δm = 6 × 1.007 276 + 6 × 1.008 665 – 11.996 710 = 0.098 936 u\r\n結合能 = 0.098 936 × 931 = 92.1 MeV\r\n每個核子結合能 = 92.1\r\n12\r\n = 7.68 MeV\r\n(b) 鈾-234 原子核的每個核子結合能\r\n = Δm × 931\r\nA = 1.909 380 × 931\r\n234\r\n = 7.60 MeV\r\n碳-12 原子核的每個核子結合能較大，所以較穩定。\r\n碳-12 原子核 11.996 710 u\r\n質子 1.007 276 u\r\n中子 1.008 665 u\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E304-2":{"id":"ex-E304-2","chapter":"E304","number":2,"title":"核裂變釋出的能量","question":"<p>以下方程顯示鈾-235 原子核吸收一個中子後分裂成較輕原子核的一種可能情況。</p><p><sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup>n + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>U</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ba</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Kr</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + 3<sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup>n</p><p>下表列出各粒子的每核子結合能。</p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>粒子</p></td><td><p>每核子結合能 / MeV</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>U</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p>7.590 937</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ba</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p>8.265 550</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Kr</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p></td><td><p>8.616 942</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>(a) 求反應釋放的能量，分別以 (i) MeV 及 (ii) J 表示。</p><p>(b) 說明反應中粒子總質量的變化。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) (i) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>U</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的結合能 = 7.590 937 × 235 = 1783.87 MeV</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ba</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的結合能 = 8.265 550 × 144 = 1190.24 MeV</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Kr</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的結合能 = 8.616 942 × 89 = 766.91 MeV</p><p>釋放的能量 = 1190.24 + 766.91 – 1783.87 = 173 MeV</p><p>(ii) 釋放的能量 = 173 × 10<sup>6</sup> × 1.60 × 10<sup>−19</sup> = 2.77 × 10<sup>−11</sup> J</p><p>(b) 減少</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>1 eV = 1.60 × 10<sup>−19</sup> J</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E304_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"fe67be946f6c7a0b0febd024507af8bce41fed7f65ad19662b0c0b1784b0188e","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49989511718741,557.6491,298.7991943359375],"text":"例 題 2 核裂變釋出的能量\r\n鈾-235 原子核吸收一中子後，會分裂成較輕的原子核。以下是其中一\r\n個可能出現的核反應。\r\n1\r\n0n + 235\r\n92U → 144\r\n56Ba + 89\r\n36Kr + 31\r\n0n\r\n下表顯示各粒子的每個核子結合能。\r\n粒 子 每個核子結合能 / MeV\r\n235\r\n92U 7.590 937\r\n144\r\n56Ba 8.265 550\r\n89\r\n36Kr 8.616 942\r\n(a) 求上述核反應釋出的能量，答案以 (i) MeV 和 (ii) J 為單位。\r\n(b) 在上述核反應前後，粒子的總質量有甚麼變化？\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,298.7991943359375,557.6491,451.3358951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) (i) 235\r\n92U 的結合能 = 7.590 937 × 235 = 1783.87 MeV\r\n 144\r\n56Ba 的結合能 = 8.265 550 × 144 = 1190.24 MeV\r\n 89\r\n36Kr 的結合能 = 8.616 942 × 89 = 766.91 MeV\r\n 釋出的能量 = 1190.24 + 766.91 – 1783.87 = 173 MeV\r\n(ii) 釋出的能量 = 173 × 106 × 1.60 × 10 − 19 = 2.77 × 10 − 11 J\r\n(b) 減少\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718741,176.6491,451.3358951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n1 eV = 1.60 × 10–19 J\r\n上述核反應會釋放能量，根\r\n據 E = mc2\r\n，核反應產物的\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E304-3":{"id":"ex-E304-3","chapter":"E304","number":3,"title":"根據結合能曲線判斷核反應類型","question":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是兩種不同核素，右圖顯示兩者在結合能曲線上的位置。</p><p>(a) 根據曲線，估計 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的結合能。</p><p>(b) 哪個核素較可能發生聚變？試解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/f5db31c88dd934e0970e1459.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:250.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 結合能 = 8 × 200 = 1600 MeV</p><p>(b) 如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 發生聚變，形成的核素會有較高的每個核子結合能，所以較穩定；如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 發生聚變，形成的核素會有較低的每個核子結合能，所以較不穩定，因此，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 較可能發生聚變。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>從結合能曲線，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>b</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>A</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 8, A = 200.</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E304_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"fe67be946f6c7a0b0febd024507af8bce41fed7f65ad19662b0c0b1784b0188e","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,53.49989511718741,557.6491,244.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 3 根據結合能曲線判斷核反應類型\r\nX 和 Y 是兩種不同核素，右圖顯\r\n示兩者在結合能曲線上的位置。\r\n(a) 根據曲線，估計 Y 的結合能。\r\n(b) 哪個核素較可能發生聚變？試\r\n解釋。\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,244.81585693359375,557.6491,359.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 結合能 = 8 × 200 = 1600 MeV\r\n(b) 如果 X 發生聚變，形成的核素會有較高的每個核子結合能，所以\r\n較穩定；如果 Y 發生聚變，形成的核素會有較低的每個核子結合\r\n能，所以較不穩定，因此，X 較可能發生聚變。\r\n10\r\n8\r\n6\r\n4\r\n2\r\n0\r\nX\r\nY\r\n50 100 150 200 250\r\n每個核子結合能 / MeV\r\n質量數\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.49989511718741,176.6491,359.3528951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n根據結合能曲線，可得：\r\nEb\r\nA\r\n = 8，A = 200。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E304-4":{"id":"ex-E304-4","chapter":"E304","number":4,"title":"南丫風采發電站的功率","question":"<p>在南丫風采發電站，風力渦輪機的扇葉長25 m。假設風速是 5.56 m s<sup>–1</sup>，渦輪機的效率是 35%，空氣密度是 1.225 kg m<sup>–3</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求風力渦輪機輸出的最大功率，答案以kW 為單位。</p><p>(b) 如果風速上升 50%，渦輪機的最大功率是多少？假設渦輪機的效率不變。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5a4cc330eb2a7305b6b1fe8f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:165.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 最大功率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span>ηρ<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Av^{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 35% × 1.225 × (π × 25<sup>2</sup>) × 5.56<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 72.3 kW</p><p>(b) 由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> ∝ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v^{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 增加 50%，最大功率 = 72.3 × (1 + 50%)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 244 kW</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E304_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"fe67be946f6c7a0b0febd024507af8bce41fed7f65ad19662b0c0b1784b0188e","segments":[{"page":16,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.49989511718752,557.4491,282.81591796875],"text":"例 題 4 南丫風采發電站的功率\r\n在南丫風采發電站，風力渦輪機的扇葉長\r\n25 m。假設風速是 5.56 m s–1，渦輪機的效\r\n率是 35%，空氣密度是 1.225 kg m–3。\r\n(a) 求風力渦輪機輸出的最大功率，答案以\r\nkW 為單位。\r\n(b) 如果風速上升 50%，渦輪機的最大功率\r\n是多少？假設渦輪機的效率不變。\r\n"},{"page":16,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,282.81591796875,557.4491,472.4348951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 最大功率 = 1\r\n2\r\nηρAv3\r\n = 1\r\n2\r\n× 35% × 1.225 × (π × 252\r\n) × 5.563\r\n= 72.3 kW\r\n(b) 由於 P ∝ v3\r\n，如果 v 增加 50%，\r\n最大功率 = 72.3 × (1 + 50%)3\r\n = 244 kW\r\n25 m\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E304-5":{"id":"ex-E304-5","chapter":"E304","number":5,"title":"水力發電站的效率","question":"<p>在水力發電站內，上下水庫的水位相差 60 m。水從上水庫以流率5 m<sup>3</sup> s<sup>–1</sup> 流向下水庫，並推動連接發電機的渦輪機。渦輪機的位置低於下水庫的水位。</p><p>已知：水的密度 = 1000 kg m<sup>–3</sup></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 9.81 m s<sup>–2</sup></p><p>(a) 求水的勢能流失率，答案以 MW 為單位。</p><p>(b) 發電站的輸出功率是 2.5 MW，求發電站的效率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/bc329da2d5760d38e4b71e8b.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:281.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 水的勢能流失率</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{mgh}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{m}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> )<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">gh</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (5 × 1000) × 9.81 × 60 = 2.94 MW</p><p>(b) 發電站的效率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>輸出功率</mtext><mtext>輸入功率</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{輸出功率}{輸入功率}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100%</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2.5</mn><mn>2.94</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2.5}{2.94}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100%</p><p>= 85.0%</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E304_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"fe67be946f6c7a0b0febd024507af8bce41fed7f65ad19662b0c0b1784b0188e","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,119.22989511718754,562.4491,462.570068359375],"text":"例 題 5 水力發電站的效率\r\n發電機 60 m\r\n下水庫\r\n渦輪機\r\n上水庫 \r\n在水力發電站內，上下水庫的水位相差 60 m。水從上水庫以流率\r\n5 m3\r\n s–1 流向下水庫，並推動連接發電機的渦輪機。渦輪機的位置低\r\n於下水庫的水位。\r\n已知：水的密度 = 1000 kg m–3\r\ng = 9.81 m s–2\r\n(a) 求水的勢能流失率，答案以 MW 為單位。\r\n(b) 發電站的輸出功率是 2.5 MW，求發電站的效率。\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,462.570068359375,562.4491,652.6068951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 水的勢能流失率\r\n = mgh\r\nt = •\r\nm\r\nt\r\n•\r\ngh = (5 × 1000) × 9.81 × 60 = 2.94 MW\r\n(b) 發電站的效率 = 輸出功率\r\n輸入功率 × 100% \r\n = 2.5\r\n2.94\r\n× 100% \r\n = 85.0%\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E304-6":{"id":"ex-E304-6","chapter":"E304","number":6,"title":"表面接收到的太陽輻射功率","question":"<p>某人造衞星位於地球大氣層的外表面，它有一塊面積為 0.64 m<sup>2</sup> 的平板，受陽光照射。</p><p>太陽常數是 1366 W m<sup>–2</sup>。估算在以下情況中，平板所接收的總太陽輻射功率。</p><p>(a) 陽光正照平板圖 a</p><p>(b) 陽光以 60°角射向平板（圖 a）</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/891e5d7f7f4aa85e200813b2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:177.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 接收的總太陽輻射功率 = 太陽常數 × 面積</p><p>= 1366 × 0.64</p><p>= 874 W</p><p>(b) 接收的總太陽輻射功率 =（ 太陽常數 × cos θ） × 面積</p><p>=（ 1366 × cos 60°） × 0.64</p><p>= 437 W</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E304_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"fe67be946f6c7a0b0febd024507af8bce41fed7f65ad19662b0c0b1784b0188e","segments":[{"page":23,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,53.49989511718741,562.4491,218.81585693359375],"text":"例 題 6 表面接收到的太陽輻射功率\r\n某人造衞星位於地球大氣層的外表面，它有\r\n一塊面積為 0.64 m2 的平板，受陽光照射。\r\n太陽常數是 1366 W m–2。估算在以下情況\r\n中，平板所接收的總太陽輻射功率。\r\n(a) 陽光正照平板\r\n(b) 陽光以 60°角射向平板（圖 a）\r\n"},{"page":23,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,218.81585693359375,562.4491,377.3528951171875],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 接收的總太陽輻射功率 = 太陽常數 × 面積\r\n= 1366 × 0.64\r\n= 874 W\r\n(b) 接收的總太陽輻射功率 = （太陽常數 × cos θ）× 面積\r\n = （1366 × cos 60°）× 0.64\r\n= 437 W\r\n60°\r\n陽光\r\n平板\r\n圖 a\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-E304-7":{"id":"ex-E304-7","chapter":"E304","number":7,"title":"太陽能熱水器","question":"<p>某個太陽能熱水器的集熱器是平的，面積為 4 m<sup>2</sup>。陽光垂直照射集熱器 30 分鐘，把水加熱。太陽常數是 1366 W m<sup>–2</sup>，大氣層吸收了25% 的太陽輻射功率。假設熱水器的效率是 45%，估算水吸收了多少太陽能。</p>","answer":"<p>在地球表面每單位面積的太陽輻射功率</p><p>= 1366 ×（ 1 – 25%） = 1025 W m<sup>–2</sup> 集熱器收集到的能量 = 1025 × 4 ×（ 30 × 60） = 7.38 × 10<sup>6</sup> J 水吸收的能量 = 7.38 × 10<sup>6</sup> × 45% = 3.32 × 10<sup>6</sup> J</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_E304_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"fe67be946f6c7a0b0febd024507af8bce41fed7f65ad19662b0c0b1784b0188e","segments":[{"page":24,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,511.8428951171875,557.4491,636.1591949462891],"text":"例 題 7 太陽能熱水器\r\n某個太陽能熱水器的集熱器是平的，面積為 4 m2\r\n。陽光垂直照射集\r\n熱器 30 分鐘，把水加熱。太陽常數是 1366 W m–2，大氣層吸收了\r\n25% 的太陽輻射功率。假設熱水器的效率是 45%，估算水吸收了多\r\n少太陽能。\r\n"},{"page":24,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,636.1591949462891,557.4491,747.6958951171875],"text":"題解\r\n在地球表面每單位面積的太陽輻射功率\r\n= 1366 ×（1 – 25%） = 1025 W m–2\r\n集熱器收集到的能量 = 1025 × 4 ×（30 × 60） = 7.38 × 106\r\n J\r\n水吸收的能量 = 7.38 × 106 × 45% = 3.32 × 106\r\n J\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}